<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX WINS PLN 6.3 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX WINS PLN 6.3 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA signed a 6.3-million-zloty contract with the town of Sochaczew, central Poland, for the expansion of its sewage treatment facilities, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said work on the project would last from October 15 this year to June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
